---
import Simple from '../layouts/Simple.astro';
---

<Simple title="NotchOS Privacy" description="How NotchOS handles data.">
  <h1 class="simple__title">Privacy</h1>
  <p class="simple__lead">
    NotchOS is built to stay on your Mac. License activation talks to our server; your files and clipboard do
    not.
  </p>
  <ul class="simple__list">
    <li>Activation sends a hashed device id, optional Mac name, app version, email, and key.</li>
    <li>Writing tools run on-device when available.</li>
    <li>We do not sell personal data.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="simple__note">Full privacy policy before launch.</p>
</Simple>
